      "remediation": {
        "description": "Bucket CORS configuration contains a rule with AllowedOrigins set to \"*\" and the bucket is not tagged as cors_wildcard_intended=true.",
        "action": "Replace \"*\" in AllowedOrigins with the specific origins that need cross-origin access. If the bucket is a public CDN or static asset origin where wildcard CORS is intentional, add the tag cors_wildcard_intended=true to declare intent. To remove CORS entirely, run \"aws s3api delete-bucket-cors --bucket \u003cname\u003e\".",
